<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Imports — Range Ledger</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Hanken+Grotesk:wght@600;650;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Source+Sans+3:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      background-color: #F5F5F5;
      color: #262626;
      font-family: 'Source Sans 3', sans-serif;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 24px;
      min-height: 100vh;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    /* Typography */
    h1, .h1 {
      font-family: 'Hanken Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-size: 32px;
      line-height: 40px;
      font-weight: 650;
      color: #262626;
    }

    h2, .h2 {
      font-family: 'Hanken Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 32px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #262626;
    }

    h3, .h3 {
      font-family: 'Hanken Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 24px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #262626;
    }

    .mono {
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    }

    .text-quiet {
      color: #626262;
    }

    /* Motion Tokens & Keyframes */
    @keyframes page-entrance {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(6px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    @keyframes live-breathe {
      0%, 100% {
        opacity: 0.82;
      }
      50% {
        opacity: 0.86;
      }
    }

    .page-enter {
      animation: page-entrance 320ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
    }

    .anim-breathe {
      animation: live-breathe 8s cubic-bezier(0.65, 0, 0.35, 1) infinite;
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *, *::before, *::after {
        animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
        animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
        transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
      }
    }

    /* Header */
    header {
      background-color: #FFFFFF;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D8D8;
      height: 64px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0 24px;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
    }

    .brand-group {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .brand-mark {
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
      background-color: #262626;
      border-radius: 4px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      font-family: 'Hanken Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .brand-name {
      font-family: 'Hanken Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 650;
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #262626;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    nav.header-menu {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
      margin-left: 32px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      scrollbar-width: none;
    }
    nav.header-menu::-webkit-scrollbar {
      display: none;
    }

    .menu-item {
      color: #626262;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 500;
      white-space: nowrap;
      transition: color 150ms ease;
    }

    .menu-item:hover {
      color: #262626;
    }

    .menu-item.active {
      color: #B3473D;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .user-profile {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-left: 24px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .profile-photo {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      object-fit: cover;
      aspect-ratio: 1/1;
      border: 1px solid #D8D8D8;
    }

    .user-details {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .user-name {
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #262626;
    }

    .user-role {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #626262;
    }

    /* Layout Container */
    main.container {
      max-width: 1280px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 32px 24px 64px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    /* Panels */
    .panel {
      background-color: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1px solid #D8D8D8;
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 24px;
    }

    /* Buttons & Controls */
    button, .btn {
      height: 44px;
      padding: 0 16px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-family: 'Source Sans 3', sans-serif;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: background-color 150ms ease, border-color 150ms ease, color 150ms ease;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    button:focus-visible, .btn:focus-visible, input:focus-visible, select:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid #B3473D;
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background-color: #B3473D;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1px solid #B3473D;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      background-color: #9d3c33;
      border-color: #9d3c33;
    }

    .btn-primary:active {
      background-color: #88342c;
      border-color: #88342c;
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background-color: #FFFFFF;
      color: #262626;
      border: 1px solid #D8D8D8;
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background-color: #F5F5F5;
      border-color: #C0C0C0;
    }

    .btn-secondary:active {
      background-color: #EBEBEB;
    }

    /* Error Banner */
    .error-banner {
      background-color: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1px solid #A13D36;
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 20px 24px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .error-banner-content {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 4px;
    }

    .error-banner-title {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #A13D36;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .error-banner-desc {
      color: #626262;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 22px;
    }

    .indicator-dot {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: inline-block;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .dot-failed {
      background-color: #A13D36;
    }

    .dot-waiting {
      background-color: #805600;
    }

    .dot-good {
      background-color: #286143;
    }

    /* Page Header Section */
    .page-title-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .page-meta-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-end;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .adapter-desc {
      color: #626262;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 24px;
      max-width: 720px;
    }

    /* Status chips */
    .status-chip {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 18px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .status-chip.good {
      background-color: #F0F6F2;
      color: #286143;
      border: 1px solid #D1E3D8;
    }

    .status-chip.waiting {
      background-color: #FCF8EE;
      color: #805600;
      border: 1px solid #F2E4BF;
    }

    .status-chip.failed {
      background-color: #FDF3F2;
      color: #A13D36;
      border: 1px solid #F3CECA;
    }

    /* Worklist Filter Bar */
    .filter-bar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .filter-group {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .filter-select {
      height: 44px;
      padding: 0 12px;
      background-color: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1px solid #D8D8D8;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-family: 'Source Sans 3', sans-serif;
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #262626;
      min-width: 170px;
    }

    .filter-input {
      height: 44px;
      padding: 0 12px;
      background-color: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1px solid #D8D8D8;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-family: 'Source Sans 3', sans-serif;
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #262626;
      min-width: 220px;
    }

    /* Table Styles */
    .table-container {
      width: 100%;
      overflow-x: auto;
      border: 1px solid #D8D8D8;
      border-radius: 4px;
      background-color: #FFFFFF;
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      text-align: left;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    thead th {
      background-color: #FAFAFA;
      color: #626262;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D8D8;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    tbody tr {
      height: 48px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D8D8;
      transition: background-color 120ms ease;
    }

    tbody tr:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    tbody tr:hover {
      background-color: #FAFAFA;
    }

    td {
      padding: 10px 16px;
      vertical-align: middle;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    /* Checkbox */
    input[type="checkbox"] {
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      border: 1px solid #D8D8D8;
      cursor: pointer;
      accent-color: #B3473D;
    }

    /* Section divider */
    .section-divider {
      border: none;
      height: 2px;
      background-color: #D8D8D8;
      margin: 8px 0;
    }

    /* Outcome Summary Grid */
    .outcome-summary-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }

    .outcome-card {
      border: 1px solid #D8D8D8;
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 16px;
      background-color: #FFFFFF;
    }

    .outcome-card-header {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #626262;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    .outcome-card-value {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #262626;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .outcome-card-note {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #626262;
      margin-top: 4px;
      line-height: 20px;
    }

    /* Activity section */
    .activity-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 16px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D8D8;
    }

    .activity-row:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
      padding-bottom: 0;
    }

    .activity-avatar {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      object-fit: cover;
      aspect-ratio: 1/1;
      border: 1px solid #D8D8D8;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .activity-content {
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 4px;
    }

    .activity-topline {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .activity-actor {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #262626;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .activity-time {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #626262;
    }

    .activity-details {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #262626;
      line-height: 22px;
    }

    /* Mobile Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 840px) {
      header {
        padding: 0 16px;
      }

      nav.header-menu {
        display: none;
      }

      main.container {
        padding: 20px 16px 48px;
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .panel {
        padding: 16px;
      }

      tbody tr {
        height: 56px;
      }

      button, .btn, .filter-select, .filter-input {
        height: 48px;
      }

      .error-banner {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Shared Application Header -->
  <header>
    <div class="brand-group">
      <div class="brand-mark" aria-label="Range Ledger Logo Mark">R</div>
      <div class="brand-name">Range Ledger</div>
      <nav class="header-menu" aria-label="Primary Navigation">
        <a href="#yard" class="menu-item">Yard</a>
        <a href="#imports" class="menu-item active">Imports</a>
        <a href="#allocations" class="menu-item">Allocations</a>
        <a href="#lots" class="menu-item">Lots</a>
        <a href="#inventory" class="menu-item">Inventory</a>
        <a href="#feed-outlook" class="menu-item">Feed outlook</a>
        <a href="#rations" class="menu-item">Rations</a>
        <a href="#feed-plans" class="menu-item">Feed plans</a>
        <a href="#feeding" class="menu-item">Feeding</a>
        <a href="#reports" class="menu-item">Reports</a>
        <a href="#feed-to-gain" class="menu-item">Feed-to-gain</a>
        <a href="#profitability" class="menu-item">Profitability</a>
        <a href="#sample-data" class="menu-item">Sample data</a>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="user-profile">
      <img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AEtjO1XAa7uvZd7Xq8LVl_nyzCwqfifo5S6bt0Dwmj_uVv_13qIjTopbTcMRV94ox3iN8ULgXo2vznLkVlz31bs8teT8by1wA62yy1ry7klO75WokSA-IkFpyxbACGxhtheKwKQX-e88klqVxhe4IxXXXTx6bgUwQnd4nbYU7L7R4lck42xeScWus_KDd37-Jw-7tv9p2AbMuB-8Dq5qiCKYc7nOWvqfL-_dbCLyq5SIYcAB8211dHwunN_vaPqG" alt="Maya Chen portrait" class="profile-photo" width="36" height="36">
      <div class="user-details">
        <span class="user-name">Maya Chen</span>
        <span class="user-role">Yard manager</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Main Content Container -->
  <main class="container page-enter">

    <!-- Page Title & Primary Actions -->
    <div class="page-title-row">
      <div class="page-meta-row">
        <div>
          <h1>Imports</h1>
          <p class="adapter-desc">Mock procurement and receiving adapter for Red Mesa Yard — source document ingestion, lot matching, and head allocation check.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <button class="btn btn-primary" id="preview-btn">
            Preview selected records
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Inline Error State Banner -->
    <section class="error-banner" aria-live="assertive">
      <div class="error-banner-content">
        <div class="error-banner-title">
          <span class="indicator-dot dot-failed anim-breathe"></span>
          Failed — Procurement and receiving data connection error
        </div>
        <div class="error-banner-desc">
          The mock procurement and receiving adapter service could not return real-time import stream telemetry for Red Mesa Yard. Displaying cached source baseline context while live ingestion is unavailable.
        </div>
      </div>
      <button class="btn btn-primary" id="retry-btn">
        Retry connection
      </button>
    </section>

    <!-- Procurement & Receiving Worklist Panel -->
    <section class="panel">
      <div class="filter-bar">
        <div class="filter-group">
          <label for="po-filter" class="text-quiet" style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;">Document source:</label>
          <select id="po-filter" class="filter-select">
            <option value="PO-8841" selected>Source PO-8841 (Red Mesa Yard)</option>
            <option value="all">All received purchase orders</option>
          </select>

          <label for="status-filter" class="text-quiet" style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;">Adapter status:</label>
          <select id="status-filter" class="filter-select">
            <option value="all" selected>All line statuses</option>
            <option value="matched">Matched (retained)</option>
            <option value="conflict">Allocation conflict</option>
            <option value="created">Created as lot</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div style="font-size: 14px; color: #626262;">
          Showing <span class="mono" style="font-weight: 600; color: #262626;">3</span> source records from <span class="mono" style="font-weight: 600; color: #262626;">PO-8841</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Formal Worklist Table with Horizontal Overflow on Phone -->
      <div class="table-container">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th style="width: 44px; text-align: center;">
                <input type="checkbox" checked aria-label="Select all source records">
              </th>
              <th>Source Line</th>
              <th>Animal Description</th>
              <th>Source Head Count</th>
              <th>Existing Match</th>
              <th>Received Result</th>
              <th>Adapter Outcome</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <!-- Line 1: Angus steers, updated 80 head vs 82 mapped -->
            <tr>
              <td style="text-align: center;">
                <input type="checkbox" checked aria-label="Select Line 1">
              </td>
              <td>
                <span class="mono" style="font-weight: 600;">Line 1</span>
              </td>
              <td>Angus steers</td>
              <td>
                <span class="mono" style="font-weight: 600;">80</span> head
                <span class="text-quiet" style="font-size: 13px; margin-left: 4px;">(latest count)</span>
              </td>
              <td>
                <span class="mono" style="font-weight: 600;">L-2407</span>
                <span class="text-quiet" style="font-size: 13px; margin-left: 4px;">in Pen P-04</span>
              </td>
              <td>
                <span class="mono" style="font-weight: 600;">80</span> head matched to <span class="mono">L-2407</span>
              </td>
              <td>
                <span class="status-chip waiting">
                  <span class="indicator-dot dot-waiting"></span>
                  Allocation conflict (80 below 82 mapped)
                </span>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Line 2: Hereford steers, 126 head matched to L-2409 -->
            <tr>
              <td style="text-align: center;">
                <input type="checkbox" checked aria-label="Select Line 2">
              </td>
              <td>
                <span class="mono" style="font-weight: 600;">Line 2</span>
              </td>
              <td>Hereford steers</td>
              <td>
                <span class="mono" style="font-weight: 600;">126</span> head
              </td>
              <td>
                <span class="mono" style="font-weight: 600;">L-2409</span>
                <span class="text-quiet" style="font-size: 13px; margin-left: 4px;">in Pen P-07</span>
              </td>
              <td>
                <span class="mono" style="font-weight: 600;">126</span> head matched to <span class="mono">L-2409</span>
              </td>
              <td>
                <span class="status-chip good">
                  <span class="indicator-dot dot-good"></span>
                  Matched, not duplicated
                </span>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Line 3: Charolais-cross steers, 94 head created as L-2413 -->
            <tr>
              <td style="text-align: center;">
                <input type="checkbox" checked aria-label="Select Line 3">
              </td>
              <td>
                <span class="mono" style="font-weight: 600;">Line 3</span>
              </td>
              <td>Charolais-cross steers</td>
              <td>
                <span class="mono" style="font-weight: 600;">94</span> head
              </td>
              <td>
                <span class="mono" style="font-weight: 600;">L-2413</span>
                <span class="text-quiet" style="font-size: 13px; margin-left: 4px;">in Pen P-12</span>
              </td>
              <td>
                Created as <span class="mono" style="font-weight: 600;">L-2413</span> on first import
              </td>
              <td>
                <span class="status-chip good">
                  <span class="indicator-dot dot-good"></span>
                  Created on first import
                </span>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <!-- Adapter Returned Result Summaries -->
      <div style="margin-top: 24px;">
        <h3 style="margin-bottom: 12px;">Mock Adapter Ingestion Outcomes</h3>
        <div class="outcome-summary-grid">
          <div class="outcome-card">
            <div class="outcome-card-header">First-Import Execution (2025-06-13)</div>
            <div class="outcome-card-value">
              <span class="status-chip good">2 matched, 1 created</span>
            </div>
            <p class="outcome-card-note">Initial batch intake successfully associated Lines 1 and 2 to existing lot references and created new lot <span class="mono" style="color: #262626; font-weight: 500;">L-2413</span> for Line 3 Charolais-cross steers.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="outcome-card">
            <div class="outcome-card-header">Repeat-Import Execution (2025-06-18)</div>
            <div class="outcome-card-value">
              <span class="status-chip waiting">Matched, not duplicated</span>
            </div>
            <p class="outcome-card-note">Repeated run matched existing lot records without generating duplicate identifiers; Line 1 returned updated source count of <span class="mono" style="color: #262626; font-weight: 500;">80</span> head against <span class="mono" style="color: #262626; font-weight: 500;">82</span> already mapped.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="outcome-card">
            <div class="outcome-card-header">Allocation Status Check</div>
            <div class="outcome-card-value">
              <span class="status-chip waiting">Allocation conflict</span>
            </div>
            <p class="outcome-card-note">L-2407 in Pen P-04 retains 82 mapped head against source 80. Allocation retained for operational review rather than forcing automatic silent agreement.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

